Q: Pseudo class v/s Pseudo elements

answer: 
pseudo-class -> Pseudo class is applied on a certain state or condition of an element.
code:
input:disabled {}
input:focus {}
button:hover{}
li:first-child{}
a:visited{}

:: pseudo-element -> Pseudo element is applied on part of a element or virtual elements created with ::before or ::after
code:
p::first-line{}
p::first-letter{}
input::placeholder{}
a::before{}
a::after{}
